    "Name": "BattleAxe BKX-7NC",
    "Details": "The first native Battlemech to be built by the FedSuns, the 70 ton Battleaxe debuted in 2459. Based off of the technology used in the Mackie, the Battleaxe would be constantly updated with new technology, before being retired after the Reunification War when newer designs such as the Hammerhands and Warhammer entered service. The Battleaxe BKX-7KNC is the mass production model. Built around a 280-rated Fusion Core, the BKX-7KNC is armed with a pair of PPC’s and 4 LRM-5’s. An SRM-6 provides some close range firepower.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Stable</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.08</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Left Lower, Right Lower</color>",
    "Icon": "Battleaxe"
  },
